{"sourceUrl":"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1004/3052.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:12.792114+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1004/3052.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为促进高校优秀大学生之间的交流，加深青年学生对我院学科前沿成果的了解，吸引优秀本科生到我院攻读硕士学位，我院将举办</span><span>“</span><span>2026</span><span>年吉林大学护理学院校园学术活动开放日</span><span>”</span><span>活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、申请资格</span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法、身心健康、品德良好，在校期间没有受过纪律处分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有较高的培养潜质。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>护理学<span>(</span>护理学、助产学<span>)</span>、医学技术</span><span>(</span><span>康复治疗学、医学检验技术、医学影像技术</span><span>)</span><span>及其相关专业<span>2027</span>年应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span><span>将获得所读大学免试推荐研究生资格，或成绩优异拟参加硕士研究生统考的学生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span><span>英语水平良好，全国大学外语四级考试成绩在<span>425</span>分以上。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>二、日程安排</span></p>\n<p><span><span>本届校园学术活动开放日将于<span>2026</span>年<span>7</span>月<span>7</span>日<span>-7</span>月<span>8</span>日线下举办，主要包括学院及学科介绍、专家讲座、参观校园、个人学术能力考核等，具体安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>三、申报方法</span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>网上报名</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请参加校园学术活动开放日的同学务必通过吉林大学“校园学术活动开放日报名系统”（网址为<span>https://yzbbm.jlu.edu.cn/</span>）报名，<span>截止时间为<span>2026</span>年<span>6</span>月<span>29</span>日中午<span>12</span>：<span>:00</span>，逾期不再受理</span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>提交材料</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（<span>1</span>）《吉林大学护理学院<span>2026</span>年全国优秀大学生校园学术活动开放日报名表》（系统自动生成）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（<span>2</span>）身份证正反面、学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（<span>3</span>）由教务处或所在院系开具的总评成绩排名证明（附件<span>1</span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（<span>4</span>）成绩单一份，需加盖教务部门<span>/</span>或所在院系公章；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（<span>5</span>）个人简历一份，无特殊格式要求；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（<span>6</span>）外语水平证明（英语四、六级证书等）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（<span>7</span>）其它获奖证明材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>提交事项：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>1.材料（<span>1</span>）请提交<span>PDF</span>版本，命名为本科学校<span>+护<a href=\"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1004/3052.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></span><a href=\"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1004/3052.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">理<span>/</span>医学技术<span>+</span>姓名<span>+</span>报名表；材料（<span>2</span>）<span>-</span>（<span>6</span>）项，请扫描形成一个完整的<span>PDF</span>文档命名为本科学校<span>+</span>护理<span>/</span>医学技术<span>+</span>姓名<span>+</span>基本材料；材料（<span>7</span>）请扫描形成一个完整的<span>PDF</span>文档命名为本科学校<span>+</span>护理<span>/</span>医学技术<span>+</span>姓名<span>+</span>证明材料；三份文件放置于一个压缩包中，压缩包命名为：本科学校<span>+</span>护理<span>/</span>医学技术<span>+</span>姓名<span>+</span>开放日</a></span><a href=\"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1004/3052.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></span><a href=\"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1004/3052.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>”，填写上传到以下链接中</span></a><span><a href=\"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1004/3052.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://hui51.cn/l#0/6a336164d330b7c33fd3bc9e\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1004/3052.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><a href=\"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1004/3052.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><a href=\"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1004/3052.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://hui51.cn/l#0/6a336164d330b7c33fd3bc9e\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://hui51.cn/l#0/6a336164d330b7c33fd3bc9e</a></span></span></span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>2.请务必确认材料信息真实有效，确认无误后再提交，每人仅允许发送一次。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.以上电子版材料接收截止日期为<span>2026</span>年<span>6</span>月<span>29</span>日中午<span>12</span>：<span>:00</span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>四、综合考核</span></p>\n<p><span><span>综合考核以面试形式进行。主要包括专业素质能力、综合素质能力和外语听说能力测试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>五、其他</span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>我院将根据申请同学的学业水平、科研能力等，进行入围资格审查，<span>入围名单将于<span>7</span>月<span>1</span>日之前在学院官网（<span><a href=\"http://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/</a></span>）公布</span>，请及时关注。未入围同学不再另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>开放日期间学院免费提供午餐；对确认录取为我校推免研究生的同学，入学后学院负责报销其从学校或家庭所在地往返长春市的汽车或火车硬席、动车<span>/</span>高铁二等座交通费（不超高铁二等座价格），报销时需提供往返车票，学校或家庭所在地是长春市的不在报销范围内。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>如有未尽事宜，由学院校园学术活动开放日工作小组负责解释。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>    联系人：赵老师</span></p>\n<p><span>    电话：<span>0431-85619559</span></span></p>\n<p><span>    咨询邮箱：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:hlxyxskfr2026@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">hlxyxskfr2026@163.com</a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span>吉林大学护理学院</span></p>\n<p><span>2026</span><span>年<span>6</span>月<span>18</span>日</span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"98112bc3c2fc3b362c91181eb0824b9929a3233946440fc2a0f92c875c84f4a8","textLength":1347,"sourceSha256":"91351cc5f80bc72b4b20921b352355ca14cf4e9f9f07736bdda5c60fa48c083d","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1成绩排名证明.doc","url":"https://hlxy.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=2072536518&wbfileid=18146334"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d25aacf42dc397d007b4","title":"2026年吉林大学护理学院2026年校园学术活动开放日通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:12.792114+00:00"}
